id: unleash-dormant-power
name: Unleash Dormant Power
advancement: true
prerequisite: 5 Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 20
# "You may choose to spend 2 additional Actions and Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Maximum Ki Points (this does not affect
# your Capacity) to apply one of the following effects" - which, asked in its window; paid and counted - "twice per
# Combat Encounter and you cannot apply this effect twice to the same Ally". What each does is said on the card: the
# Awakenings, the Transformation Maneuver, Enhancements and Forms are not in this system yet - the table's.
enhanceUnleash: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  2 Actions and half your Maximum Ki more: an Awakening, an Out-of-Sequence Transformation, an Enhancement or a Form for
  the Ally - twice an Encounter, once an Ally.
text: >
  Unleash Dormant Power: You can reach into others and draw out the power from deep within them.
  –Prerequisites: 5 Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 20 TP
  –Effect: When you target a Character with the Magical Enhancement Unique Ability, you may choose to spend 2 additional
  Actions and Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Maximum Ki Points (this does not affect your Capacity) to apply one of the
  following effects to your targeted Ally:

  * Your targeted Ally gains a stack of the Unlocked Potential Awakening as a Level 2 Temporary Awakening.

  * Your targeted Ally may use the Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If they do, increase their
  Stress Bonus by ½ (rounded up) of your Tier of Power for the duration of this Transformation Maneuver and then until
  they leave that Transformation if they succeed.

  * With your ARC’s approval, your targeted Ally gains access to an Enhancement they meet the Racial Requirements,
  Prerequisites, and Tier of Power Requirement of until the end of the Combat Encounter.

  * With your ARC’s approval, your targeted Ally gains access to a Form they meet the Racial Requirements, Prerequisites,
  and Tier of Power Requirement of until the end of the Combat Encounter.

  You can only use the effect of Unleash Dormant Power twice per Combat Encounter and you cannot apply this effect twice
  to the same Ally during a Combat Encounter.
